{"title":"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a circle with center <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is a diameter, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is a chord, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/4/d94b89b5efa49cb375e0c0071d7717badf6b1dc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BO = 5$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45b0c29e3ed3da4e975ab8ecded7b1a85c22c822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABO = \\ \\stackrel{\\frown}{CD} \\ = 60^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"162\" height=\"24\" />. Then the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/9/9891c6f80eef7810f1c8cebaf38d13ccfa8607b9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] defaultpen(linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10)); pair O=origin, A=dir(35), C=dir(155), D=dir(215), B=intersectionpoint(dir(125)--O, A--C); draw(C--A--D^^B--O^^Circle(O,1)); pair point=O; label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, dir(point--A)); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, dir(point--B)); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, dir(point--C)); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, dir(point--D)); label(&quot;$O$&quot;, O, dir(305)); label(&quot;$5$&quot;, B--O, dir(O--B)*dir(90)); label(&quot;$60^\\circ$&quot;, dir(185), dir(185)); label(&quot;$60^\\circ$&quot;, B+0.05*dir(-25), dir(-25));[/asy]\" width=\"668\" height=\"638\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/1/a51aca9805d4f4a0dc0938eeb1113a9d994ee522.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } 3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }3+\\sqrt{3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 5-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 5 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }\\text{none of the above}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"561\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f105551f628f107282e0cc6c89063f3c1faece9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CAD$\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" /> is an angle inscribed in a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/e/5ce7773d05862e55e5254e19b41913e16a812872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60{^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> arc, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/a/52a0538fc74f499cfb790f40bfd191d932539572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CAD =\\frac{60^{\\circ}}{2} = 30^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"162\" height=\"39\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/2/632b43a80c4323401f3a392c6d05e9a1477abd26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABO$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e73393067e6d6e401a5354accc7a730c7a2977aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08d5c45388de5c75af641c046d466de3592ffa98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7dfa8a2a90d521b2b03f5b82a1fb9f85dce88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> right triangle. This gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/b/abb7749a307b762e7c05be6cf784fcfe3f65aa87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AO = BO\\sqrt{3} = 5\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"165\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/1/941aec7a727d3fe1d2daf2ecf8cc7c89b702f6c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 2BO = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"135\" height=\"14\" />, and now since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is a diameter, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/7/ad70f2d9a483c26bed0d5f2f12a8d6a9d15df099.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = 2AO = 10\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"159\" height=\"21\" />. The fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is a diameter also means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea7e3a6abe557bcea78c0e9f53f4f18086e87a72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACD = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/7/0f7a55113a84ee4c04eb66f66d08310c32533ca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ACD$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> is again a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e73393067e6d6e401a5354accc7a730c7a2977aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08d5c45388de5c75af641c046d466de3592ffa98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7dfa8a2a90d521b2b03f5b82a1fb9f85dce88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> right triangle, yielding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/9068ccff0f30c6031f0462ebc9d8916d68506e04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD = \\frac{1}{2}AD = 5\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"156\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/c/4bc0a536aa0d3a957c7300f6b88bf26c697533b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}AD = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"154\" height=\"43\" />, which finally gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/a/63af89948797734369f4825269360a34d82cc872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = AC-AB = 15-10 = \\boxed{\\text{(D)} \\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"292\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME\" title=\"1985 AHSME\">1985 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" c